      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1939207848640061589",
      "text": "[7:14AM] #LagBadagryExp\n#Ojo\n#TrafficUpdate\n  Abule-Ado through Ojo Barracks down to Iyana Iba intersection is good.\n\nAlso good vehicular movement from Alaba rago, Okokomaiko, Iyana Isashi, Iyana Era, Vespa to Custom Checkpoint Ijanikin.\n\nLikewise LASU- Igando road is appreciable from Iyana Iba stretch down to Obadore for now.\nThe return journey from Obadore back to Iyana Iba underneath the bridge is free flow of traffic at the moment.\n\nDo not overspeed.\n#FollowLASTMA",
